The bug was caused by the removal of the test `prev_write_sz < pending_sz` in the signaling logic of the `hv_need_to_signal_on_read()` function. This led to the guest signaling the host unnecessarily, which could result in the host throttling the guest, perceiving it as buggy or malicious, and causing intermittent freezes during stress tests.

